### Frontend (Vite) environment variables
### Copy to `.env` for local dev only (never commit `.env`).

# Required: Supabase project URL + anon (publishable) key
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY

# Optional: if you use a custom functions gateway/proxy
# VITE_API_GATEWAY_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com

# Optional: site domain used in a few places
VITE_SITE_DOMAIN=dvtechnologies.xyz

# Optional: USD->KES conversion used for pricing display and Paystack amount calculations
VITE_USD_TO_KES_RATE=129

# Optional: Google Analytics 4 measurement ID (injected into `index.html` at build time)
# VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# Optional: Telegram channels & webstore (used for promos on the site)
VITE_TELEGRAM_CHANNEL_URL=https://t.me/+ysMSObZyNWpjNTA0
VITE_TELEGRAM_PREMIUM_URL=https://t.me/+ZYBP2Qrr-JgyYTQ0
VITE_WEBSTORE_URL=https://dtdpaymentsbot.pages.dev/

# Optional: crypto payment addresses (copy-to-clipboard payment options)
VITE_TON_PAYMENT_ADDRESS=UQALmDWaE8TLnHbdk4TQUFIJtZnOMXSoTud6ufeW8f1G12eW
VITE_USDT_TRC20_ADDRESS=TKfF9M8iUwy2VdB4Eor5et8AnFRMvzJELT

# Optional: Google reCAPTCHA v3 site key (injected into `index.html` at build time)
# VITE_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Paystack public key (pk_live_... or pk_test_...)
# NOTE: This project uses a redirect flow via Supabase Edge Functions, so the public key is NOT required
# unless you later switch to Paystack inline (PaystackPop) on the frontend.
# VITE_PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY=pk_live_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

### Supabase Edge Function secrets (set in Dashboard → Edge Functions → Secrets, or via `supabase secrets set`)

# --- AI assistant (ai-chat) ---
# OpenAI is preferred ("OPEN CODE" / OpenAI key). Cloudflare Workers AI is used as fallback.
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# Fallback provider (only needed if you don't set OPENAI_API_KEY)
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# CLOUDFLARE_AI_MODEL=@cf/meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct

# --- Telegram bot (telegram-bot + telegram-alert) ---
# Token from @BotFather — used by the webhook function and to send alerts.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=123456789:AAXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
# Your personal chat id (use @userinfobot) — auto-approved as the admin of the bot.
TELEGRAM_ADMIN_CHAT_ID=123456789
# Shared secret that must be sent as the `x-bot-secret` header when calling telegram-alert
# (used internally by contact-form). Keep it random and private.
BOT_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string

